WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.780 --> 00:00:03.780
Once we have registered,

2
00:00:05.450 --> 00:00:07.210
we can sign in through this link.

3
00:00:07.810 --> 00:00:13.080
We choose "Sign in" and pick our account.

4
00:00:14.600 --> 00:00:16.990
I'll pick my personal one.

5
00:00:17.690 --> 00:00:18.810
I'll sign in. You may have done it

6
00:00:20.280 --> 00:00:27.060
with a password or a fingerprint – each of you individually set up extra

7
00:00:27.060 --> 00:00:29.120
security measures.

8
00:00:29.300 --> 00:00:32.580
And here we are, signed in.

9
00:00:32.930 --> 00:00:35.690
How can we tell that we are signed in?

10
00:00:36.730 --> 00:00:38.970
We see our name here.

11
00:00:39.490 --> 00:00:45.230
And here is a unique little picture for each person, which is created.

12
00:00:46.680 --> 00:00:53.460
This now lets us take on certain

13
00:00:53.690 --> 00:01:00.190
work. When we clicked this "Needs review", we went to this page, and

14
00:01:00.190 --> 00:01:02.610
if we click "assign yourself",

15
00:01:03.810 --> 00:01:10.530
then this talk, this material, will be assigned to us.

16
00:01:11.130 --> 00:01:12.510
When we click…

17
00:01:12.510 --> 00:01:15.830
Let me click here as an example.

18
00:01:16.310 --> 00:01:23.150
When we do this, a process starts that also moves

19
00:01:23.150 --> 00:01:29.480
the status of this talk to

20
00:01:30.400 --> 00:01:37.220
"In progress". You see, it has changed, and after a while, within minutes, also

21
00:01:37.220 --> 00:01:43.540
"Needs review" will change to "In review", and it will show

22
00:01:43.540 --> 00:01:50.400
your name. It is not instant, because this page is cached in

23
00:01:50.400 --> 00:01:56.960
everyone's browser. So it arrives after a while; there are some delays.

24
00:01:57.100 --> 00:02:03.580
But the main thing is here: once you have taken it on here, within a few

25
00:02:03.580 --> 00:02:05.720
minutes it reaches everywhere.

26
00:02:08.720 --> 00:02:14.060
Likewise, if you need to step down, you can unassign yourself,

27
00:02:16.520 --> 00:02:21.480
and it should go back, that is, it will be waiting again.

28
00:02:22.450 --> 00:02:25.630
That is how you take materials on to work on them.
